TEXT 1144 184 Left 2 ;Measure all three voltage drops over the line element\nYou can see that all have a phase of 120 degrees \nlike the phase value in phase 3. This is because over\nthe Phase 3 inductance high voltage values  are  transfered \nwith the factor k=0.5 (each 0.5*voltage drop of phase 3)\nFrom phase 2,3 actually very small voltage values are\ntransferred to phase 1 in return
